 r←GetDefaultErrorFolder;parms
⍝ Returns the folder `HandleError.Process` saves its files into when `errorFolder` is empty.
⍝ Asks `CheckErrorFolder` itself rather than mimicking its rules.
 parms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 parms.checkErrorFolder←0
 ##.HandleError.CheckErrorFolder parms
 r←parms.errorFolder
